Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Simplify ASSUN toolbar: default preset file name
 id<slave><tab>, remove Data source select and Reload button

- Save dialog now suggests file name in format id1basic (id + Slave ID + section/tab name); Load suggests the first existing preset file or the same default
- Removed 'Data source' dropdown (assun.csv/etalon.csv) and Reload button from assun.html; assun.js always uses embedded assun data
- Dropped etalon.csv remote loading logic and related handlers
---
 web/static/assun.js      | 41 +++++++++-------------------------------
 web/templates/assun.html |  7 -------
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 39 deletions(-)

